# Pairs with RetireOnlyHusk. The removal is not fenced, so a sweep that read the
# leaf as a husk removes the entry a re-created incarnation has merged into since:
# its publisher is alive. The direct form of NoTrimPastLiveNeedUnfencedRemoval,
# which needs a write and a trim to follow.
MODULE: RetireOnlyHuskUnfencedRemoval
TARGET: RetireOnlyHusk
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a husk read removes an entry a re-created incarnation merged into since
PERTURBS: Decide

--- FIND
                    /\ k \notin touched[p]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the removal is not fenced against a later merge.
                    /\ TRUE
--- END
